<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Types of Certificates</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        h2 {
            color: #34495e;
        }
        .section {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border-left: 6px solid #3498db;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        ul {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Types of Certificates</h1>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>1️⃣ SSL/TLS Certificates</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Domain Validation (DV)</b> – Basic domain verification.</li>
            <li><b>Organization Validation (OV)</b> – Business identity verified.</li>
            <li><b>Extended Validation (EV)</b> – Highest trust level.</li>
            <li><b>Wildcard Certificate</b> – Secures subdomains.</li>
            <li><b>Multi-Domain (SAN)</b> – Secures multiple domains.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>2️⃣ Educational Certificates</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>School Leaving Certificate</li>
            <li>Diploma Certificate</li>
            <li>Degree Certificate</li>
            <li>Postgraduate Certificate</li>
            <li>PhD Certificate</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>3️⃣ Professional / IT Certificates</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Microsoft Certification</li>
            <li>Cisco Certification</li>
            <li>AWS Certification</li>
            <li>Google Certification</li>
            <li>CompTIA Certification</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>4️⃣ Digital Certificates</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Code Signing Certificate</li>
            <li>Email Certificate</li>
            <li>Document Signing Certificate</li>
            <li>Client Authentication Certificate</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>5️⃣ Government Certificates</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Birth Certificate</li>
            <li>Caste Certificate</li>
            <li>Income Certificate</li>
            <li>Residence Certificate</li>
            <li>Marriage Certificate</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Category</th>
            <th>Purpose</th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>SSL/TLS</td>
            <td>Website Security</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Educational</td>
            <td>Academic Proof</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Professional</td>
            <td>Skill Validation</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Digital</td>
            <td>Encryption & Identity</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Government</td>
            <td>Legal Identity Proof</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>
</html>
